<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14854] Fix tests IgniteCacheLocalQueryDefaultTimeoutSelfTest for lazy=true mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14854</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Tests are not stable:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;IgniteCacheLocalQueryDefaultTimeoutSelfTest.testQueryTimeout&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;IgniteCacheLocalQueryDefaultTimeoutSelfTest.testQueryDefaultTimeout&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The local runs are OK. So I guess the timeout works OK. Looks like the tests must be stabilized for TC.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Root cause: the test isn&apos;t adopted for lazy mode (results aren&apos;t fetched, only iterator is opened)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
